# Torba marketplace

Learning OLX-style marketplace. Prefer Bun. Docs: root `README.md` + Figma Ready for Dev only.

## Layout

| Path | Owner | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `apps/web` | Frontend | Next.js App Router + Tailwind + react-i18next |
| `apps/api` | Backend | NestJS (`/api`, port 4000) |
| `packages/shared` | FE + BE | Shared DTOs / helpers (`@torba/shared`) |
| `scripts/` | tooling | e.g. aggregated `bun run test` |

## Ownership

- Do not edit `apps/api` on a frontend ticket (and vice versa) unless the ticket says so
- Cross-contract changes go in `packages/shared` and must be called out in the PR
- Add `features/<name>/` only when the feature exists — no empty placeholder folders
- MVP: home, catalog/search, product, cart sidebar, checkout — no seller cabinet in v1

## Code defaults

- TypeScript `strict`
- Web: keep the shell simple until Ready for Dev — stub pages, no-op controls
- Add `apps/web/src/features/<name>/` only with real feature logic
- Import shared types from `@torba/shared`
- Web tests live in `apps/web/tests/` (`*.test.ts(x)`); api/shared keep co-located `*.spec.ts`; test logic, not pure layout
- After shared type changes: `bun run build:shared`
- Run `bun run test` / `bun run lint` from the repo root when verifying
